{"schemaVersion":1,"code":"G2-03","example":{"issue":{"title":"斜交號誌路口，車道與穿越空間是否連續？","intro":"主要道路約 24 m、次要道路約 22 m，兩條道路皆有實體分隔。","images":[{"key":"results:g2-03-diagram-1","label":"現況圖","role":"diagram","rotation":0},{"key":"results:g2-03-photo-1","label":"現況照片","role":"photo","rotation":0},{"key":"results:g2-03-photo-2","label":"現況照片 2","role":"photo","rotation":0},{"key":"results:g2-03-photo-3","label":"現況照片 3","role":"photo","rotation":0}],"items":[{"id":"pedestrian","title":"穿越距離長，缺少庇護","text":"行人須一次穿越較寬道路，路口未提供庇護島。"},{"id":"lanes","title":"進出車道數不一致","text":"進入與離開路口的車道數不同，銜接與導引不夠清楚。"},{"id":"speed","title":"速限範圍不明確","text":"路面標字與速限標誌位置不同，限制範圍不易判讀。"}],"photoStatus":"available"},"sourceSlides":[74,75],"strategy":{"title":"以槽化整理寬廣斜交路口","intro":"將車流路徑、進出車道與行人庇護空間一起配置。","images":[{"key":"results:g2-03-strategy","label":"整體佈設圖","rotation":0}],"items":[{"id":"path","title":"分清各方向行車路徑","text":"以槽化線區隔不同方向車流，搭配導引線，讓轉彎路徑有清楚依循。","moduleId":"M1-01"},{"id":"balance","title":"平衡進出路口車道數","text":"重新分配路段空間，讓進入與離開路口的車道順暢銜接。","moduleId":"M1-01"},{"id":"refuge","title":"提供行人中途停等空間","text":"配置行人庇護島，並配合行穿線及號誌安排穿越動線。","moduleId":"M3-01"}]},"strategySource":{"file":"chapters/04-general-scenarios/04-2-03-signalized-urban-skewed-t.typ","sha256":"297fa2ba804c69e9fecade214662781040216786b694e2ee4f4872b1ccad44f4","section":"交通設施設置建議與整體設置圖例"}},"assets":{"results:g2-03-diagram-1":{"file":"materials/04-一般道路情境/current-conditions/G2-03/G2-03_現況圖_01.png","width":3527,"height":2245,"label":"G2-03 現況圖","scenario":"G2-03","role":"diagram","rotation":0,"sourceSlide":74,"sourcePart":"ppt/media/image88.png","sha256":"4409126d3d2cde25efc455390e1e5bb69d8ebd1b755e6a5693650e0d63f4f20c"},"results:g2-03-photo-1":{"file":"materials/04-一般道路情境/current-conditions/G2-03/G2-03_現況照片_01.png","width":2567,"height":1056,"label":"G2-03 現況照片","scenario":"G2-03","role":"photo","rotation":0,"sourceSlide":75,"sourcePart":"ppt/media/image90.png","sha256":"f4dfbd57ec4970415695945633dcd086924fa153726d04152db946572a9de7c4"},"res